; Room 38 ($26): Priests' Hole
;
; Format: see #R$C000.
; .
; Border: red (2). Conveyor: none. Ramp: none.
; .
; Items (from the item table at #R$A400): 1, at row 2 column 9.
; .
; Exits: left Room 39 (Emergency Generator, #R$E700); right Room 0 (The Off
; Licence, #R$C000); up Room 60 (The Bow, #R$FC00); down Room 32 (Halfway up
; the East Wall, #R$E000). Odd: the down exit of Room 60 is Room 0, not this
; room.
; .
; Entities: slot 0: definition $10 (at $A080) start $84; slot 1: definition
; $11 (at $A088) start $A6; slot 2: definition $12 (at $A090) start $C5; slot
; 3: definition $25 (at $A128) start $16. List ends at slot 4 ($FF).
@label=RoomPriestsHole
b$E600 DEFB $A0,$00,$0A,$00,$00,$00,$00,$00 ; row 0: ##........##....................
